<title>USA: Stifel Financial Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stifel Financial Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.10		    $0.04</p>
<p> Net			    458			162</p>
<p> Revs			24,203		   23,055</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,546		    4,470</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 total revenues include operating revenues of $20,693,000 vs $19,893,000 a year ago, and interest revenues of $3,510,000 vs $3,162,000.  </p>
<p>Q3 1996 and 1995 primary and fully diluted earnings the same.</p>
<p>		 NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.43		    $0.07</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.42		    $0.07</p>
<p> Net			  1,969			326</p>
<p> Revs			78,347		   70,698</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,533		    4,459</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,912		    5,809</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 total revenues include operating revenues of $68,278,000 vs $61,253,000 a year ago, and interest revenues of $10,069,000 vs $9,445,000.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
